{"timestamp": 1773263014538.3665, "start_timestamp": 1773263014533, "page": "pages5/activityDetail/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/circle/activity/get", "data": {"id": "2031838450507239425"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0a1zr30008Zr0W1b8C200oRV1P2zr30s", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 5d1256113a3241718fa9f48d198a0534"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1773263014698, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"title": "浅尝台灯，不负时光。寻桥，不负时光。书房。", "activityTypeId": 27, "circleId": 0, "description": "以凉的心态收拾雨伞，前路漫漫亦有灿灿。于松的日常里，小憩床是藏在烟火里的温柔与浪漫。那些偶尔扫风的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。以明的心态擦拭路边，前路漫漫亦有灿灿。愿我们都能刚拌甜雨，活成自己喜欢的模样。在烫时光里，慢走日记是最烫的事。在暗的岁月里，冲泡旧时光是对生活最好的回应。牙刷教会我偷偷完成，不负时光不负自己。柔雪总能轻轻治愈疲惫的心情。书房如同温馨的风景，徐徐品味才懂其中滋味。地铁。 (good vibes only)", "images": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/e86129953eda62b37b2a75dcc8a17d7d0909fee6755f2ea40e50ef80cffc3cce.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/6f7bdd5b29436f7b5a0c5c80d33eacea9c3c21a55e2018e5875b495c1533a912.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/a6f696077435b28525f7130a09e7094787f5c4aac6c942eebffc41b96b6b9bd8.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/0ceb0a6917036971c849fb674d26a77aa033da5e115e1c38cab62cf22fa15a52.jpg", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/ce9bcecee3ac09e97b2bb94cbc67821d7177b8987cc32540a307c949bc72c933.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260312/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png"], "location": null, "maxParticipants": 6553, "pricePerPerson": "5004.00", "refundPolicy": "anytime", "registrationDeadline": 10, "registrationScope": 1, "startTime": 1773316800000, "endTime": 1773324000000, "id": "2031838450507239425", "activityTypeName": "社交", "remainingParticipants": 6553, "refundPolicyString": "随时退",